  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252f4wkDVG6h\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ym2MQ1wH/meccha-crafteleon-title.png\" alt=\"Meccha Crafteleon\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NxEFTr4Fv3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-加入我们-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.steampowered.com%252fapp%252f4704690%252fMECCHA_CHAMELEON%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/原版游戏-Meccha Chameleon-navy?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=steam&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"原版游戏: Meccha Chameleon\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/meccha-crafteleon-smp\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/整合包-Meccha Crafteleon Together-F16436?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"整合包: Meccha Crafteleon Together\"></a></p><p>🌍 <strong>公共服务器:</strong> <code>5.196.90.238:25570</code> (MC 1.21.11)</p><blockquote>\n  <p>涂装自己，融入其中。</p>\n</blockquote><p>Meccha Crafteleon 将游戏 <strong>Meccha Chameleon</strong> 带入 Minecraft 世界。</p><p>穿上变色龙盔甲，把白色身体涂成与房间相匹配的颜色，摆好姿势，然后静止不动。\n就像在 Meccha Chameleon 中一样，通过被看见来得分。在众目睽睽之下隐藏自己！</p><p>拉上几个朋友，涂好颜色，看看谁的伪装眼光最敏锐 :)</p><p><em>对 Meccha Chameleon 的粉丝致敬，作者 <strong>lemorion_1224</strong>，并非官方作品。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.steampowered.com%252fapp%252f4704690%252fMECCHA_CHAMELEON%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">去玩原版游戏吧！</a></em></p><h2>操作控制</h2><p><code>/meccha</code> 打开菜单。R键打开姿势滚轮，F键涂色，G键吹口哨，Esc键退出。</p><h2>相册</h2><table>\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fZRNfF6Hv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Q7XJTF8h/supports-shaders.png\" alt=\"支持光影！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fbMx6gZvM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nNTwsv1N/meccha-gravel.png\" alt=\"我是砂砾！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fyC3LhG2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/XPwmyNH/meccha-sunset.png\" alt=\"噢，好美的日落！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fTB0Htjq8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z6ghx418/screen-meccha2.png\" alt=\"我们可以叠在一起！\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><table>\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fKjN9BVLF\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xSmMwzfJ/meccha-inventory.png\" alt=\"Meccha 物品栏\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fdwwkdphZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nNNQH1Wp/meccha-armors.png\" alt=\"Meccha 盔甲\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n    <td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fYB5t9NDZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZzQhsfHm/meccha-armor-upgrade.png\" alt=\"Meccha 盔甲升级\" width=\"100%\"></a></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><blockquote>\n  <p><strong>测试版：仍在开发中。</strong> Meccha Crafteleon 正在积极开发中，将频繁更新。它已经<strong>完全可玩</strong>（涂色、摆姿势、房间、捉迷藏）。后续版本将添加更多功能和细节优化，欢迎报告任何问题。</p>\n</blockquote><p><em>鸣谢：变色龙霰弹枪的 3D 模型和纹理由 <strong>ECYsh364</strong> 制作（来自 GWR3D 资源包）。</em></p><hr><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NxEFTr4Fv3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-加入我们-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252faminoquiz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/捐赠-Ko--fi-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"捐赠\"></a></p><p>有疑问、建议或想合作？<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NxEFTr4Fv3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入 Discord</a></strong>，欢迎所有人！</p><p>通过 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https